And he has appeared on Monk.
而且他还在《神探阿蒙》中客串过。

93
00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:40.300
I have a crossover with Jon Favreau.
我和乔恩·费儒有过交集。

94
00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:40.680
You do.
你确实有。

95
00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:41.780
You have an acting crossover.
你们在表演上有过交集。

96
00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:45.920
You know, we talked a lot about what it was like to work with Jon during our interview
你知道，我们在采访杰克·莱西时聊了很多关于和乔恩合作的感受，

97
00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:50.040
with Jake Lacey because this was very memorable for all of us.
因为这对我们所有人来说都非常难忘。

