Dave said that all of post-production had gone to see the first Avengers together in the theater.
戴夫说整个后期制作组一起去电影院看了第一部《复仇者联盟》。

132
00:06:04.220 --> 00:06:08.800
So this was very exciting to have Jon in their area.
所以乔恩能来到他们的工作区域，大家都很兴奋。

133
00:06:09.060 --> 00:06:10.860
I bet they were all so tickled.
我敢说他们当时一定都乐坏了。

134
00:06:10.940 --> 00:06:12.000
We were all so tickled.
我们当时都乐坏了。

135
00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:12.820
All so tickled.
全都乐坏了。

136
