也许正因如此吧。

523
00:22:47.890 --> 00:22:50.110
They're like, let's get it all in there.
他们大概是想，把所有内容都塞进去。

524
00:22:50.530 --> 00:22:58.030
Dave said, up to this point, we would use either a 21-second main title sequence or a six-second.
戴夫说，在此之前，我们用的要么是21秒的主题曲序列，要么是6秒的。

525
00:22:58.630 --> 00:23:00.990
You know, we either use a longie or a quickie.
你知道，我们要么用长的，要么用短的。

526
00:23:00.990 --> 00:23:03.430
We made an extra long one.
这次我们做了一个超长的。

527
00:23:03.570 --> 00:23:05.350
This one is 32 seconds long.
这个有32秒长。

528
00:23:05.550 --> 00:23:15.670
We needed it because when Greg decided to turn this one episode into an hour-long episode, we didn't have quite enough footage for an hour-long.
我们需要它，因为当格雷格决定把这一集拍成一小时长的特别篇时，我们的素材还不够填满一小时。

529
00:23:15.830 --> 00:23:16.510
