我们必须得注水。

530
00:23:16.510 --> 00:23:16.570
We did.
确实如此。

531
00:23:16.770 --> 00:23:22.790
So, yeah, we padded even the credit sequence with a little extra so that we could hit our time.
所以，没错，我们连片头字幕都加了点料，好凑够时长。

532
00:23:22.790 --> 00:23:24.810
The episode is now going to start.
剧集现在要开始了。

533
00:23:25.010 --> 00:23:32.170
Andy's arriving to work, and he tries to greet Aaron, but he just starts to cry, and he runs into his office.
安迪来到公司，他试图跟亚伦打招呼，但亚伦直接哭了起来，跑进了办公室。

534
00:23:33.170 --> 00:23:43.190
And I know I haven't commented on the plants at front reception in quite a while, but there is a very healthy, thriving, what looks like to be an IV at 2 minutes and 23 seconds.
我知道我好久没提过前台的植物了，但在2分23秒的时候，有一株看起来非常健康、长势茂盛的常春藤。

535
00:23:43.530 --> 00:23:44.950
Oh, that's nice.
噢，那真不错。

536
00:23:45.630 --> 00:23:46.670
I like that.
我喜欢那个。

537
00:23:47.090 --> 00:23:52.050
Well, next, Andy is going to start wailing from his office.
接下来，安迪开始在办公室里嚎啕大哭。

538
00:23:52.790 --> 00:23:59.230
