00:24:10.810 --> 00:24:11.530
Kelsey A.
来自加拿大的凯尔西·A

545
00:24:11.650 --> 00:24:13.390
from Canada had a Phyllis question.
有一个关于菲利斯的问题。

546
00:24:13.390 --> 00:24:24.150
Kelsey noted that Phyllis played the character Sadness in the Pixar movie Inside Out and wanted to know if the way she acted sad in this scene, when she says,
凯尔西提到菲利斯曾在皮克斯电影《头脑特工队》中为“忧忧”配音，她想知道菲利斯在这场戏里表现悲伤的方式，当她说，

