00:24:34.470 --> 00:24:36.230
Kelsey, I did too.
凯尔西，我也是这么想的。

550
00:24:36.230 --> 00:24:38.890
It was the first thing I thought of when I heard her say it.
我听到她那么说的时候，第一个想到的就是这个。

551
00:24:39.050 --> 00:24:39.550
Me too.
我也是。

552
00:24:40.250 --> 00:24:41.750
Well, guess what, everybody?
好吧，大家猜怎么着？

553
00:24:41.990 --> 00:24:50.830
We found out how Phyllis got picked to be Sadness in the Pixar movie Inside Out during our interview with her that just ran last week.
在上周播出的采访中，我们得知了菲利斯是如何被选中在皮克斯电影《头脑特工队》中为忧忧配音的。

554
00:24:51.210 --> 00:24:54.370
So if you missed it, definitely go back and check it out.
所以如果你错过了，一定要回去看看。

