If you just want just to listen to someone and just feel like happiness in your heart, listen to this interview because Phyllis is such a wonderful, loving person,
如果你只是想听听别人的故事，感受内心的幸福，那就去听听这次采访，因为菲利斯是一个如此美好、充满爱心的人，

556
00:25:03.470 --> 00:25:04.750
and it just shines through.
这种特质显而易见。

557
00:25:04.750 --> 00:25:05.290
Mm-hmm.
