00:25:40.670 --> 00:25:50.770
My question is, when Erin says, I mean, I saw Pete's butt, it's sick, I guess Allie and her husband, Paul, have been disagreeing about the meaning of this line for years.
我的问题是，当艾琳说“我看到了皮特的屁股，简直太棒了”时，我想艾莉和她丈夫保罗多年来一直对这句台词的意思有分歧。

