00:26:05.430 --> 00:26:09.930
But Allie thinks that Erin was happy about seeing Pete's butt.
但艾莉认为艾琳对看到皮特的屁股感到高兴。

576
00:26:10.230 --> 00:26:11.470
What are our thoughts?
我们怎么看？

577
00:26:11.750 --> 00:26:14.210
She's clearly happy about seeing his butt.
她显然对看到他的屁股感到高兴。

578
00:26:14.410 --> 00:26:15.590
Very clearly happy.
非常明显的高兴。

579
00:26:15.590 --> 00:26:19.270
It's sick, meaning like sick, like sick is awesome.
“太棒了”（sick），意思是像“酷毙了”那样。

580
00:26:19.470 --> 00:26:20.550
Yeah, like rad.
对，就像“超赞”。

581
00:26:20.830 --> 00:26:21.430
Like rad.
就像“超赞”。

582
00:26:21.890 --> 00:26:29.450
Also, in the table draft, because I still had it in my digital clutter, it had her say, I've seen his butt, it's nuts.
另外，在剧本初稿里，因为我还在数字文档里翻到了，台词写的是“我看到了他的屁股，太疯狂了”。

583
00:26:30.090 --> 00:26:30.530
Oh.
噢。

584
00:26:31.050 --> 00:26:36.050
