00:45:01.340 --> 00:45:01.700
the middle.
那就是《老友记》片头的那个喷泉。

982
00:45:01.780 --> 00:45:03.840
That's the beginning of the Friends episode.
没错。

983
00:45:04.120 --> 00:45:04.600
Yes.
是的。

984
00:45:04.960 --> 00:45:05.280
Yeah.
是啊。

985
00:45:05.500 --> 00:45:05.840
Uh-huh.
嗯哼。

986
00:45:05.960 --> 00:45:07.840
