1393
01:02:18.840 --> 01:02:23.000
This is not an office so much as it's a rec room with a bunch of computers in it.
与其说这是个办公室，不如说是个放了几台电脑的娱乐室。

1394
01:02:23.380 --> 01:02:26.680
