但不幸的是，我们几乎所有工作都得用到它们。

1396
01:02:30.220 --> 01:02:31.400
So that ain't going to happen.
所以那是不可能的。

1397
01:02:31.660 --> 01:02:35.780
You might have noticed that only one person speaks back to him.
你可能注意到了，只有一个人回应他。

1398
01:02:36.460 --> 01:02:43.340
Everybody in this bullpen were background performers, but they were very specifically
这个办公区里的每个人都是临时演员，但他们是经过特别

1399
01:02:43.340 --> 01:02:47.860
chosen to try to paint the picture of an alternate Dunder Mifflin universe.
挑选的，旨在描绘出一个平行宇宙的邓德·米夫林。

1400
01:02:47.860 --> 01:02:54.200
For example, please note the snarling woman dressed in a turtleneck and pearls at 17 minutes
例如，请注意17分钟时那个穿着高领毛衣和珍珠项链、一脸凶相的女人。

