01:02:54.200 --> 01:02:55.080
and 8 seconds.
还有8秒。

1402
01:02:55.240 --> 01:02:57.520
That is your doppelganger, Angela.
那是你的分身，安吉拉。

1403
01:02:57.960 --> 01:03:00.560
There are people playing solitaire on their computers.
有人在电脑上玩纸牌游戏。

