01:03:00.920 --> 01:03:02.100
I like Meredith.
我喜欢梅雷迪思。

1405
01:03:02.300 --> 01:03:02.920
I noticed that.
我注意到了。

1406
01:03:03.020 --> 01:03:08.380
At 17 minutes and 24 seconds, Aunt Joan was their Phyllis.
在17分24秒时，琼阿姨就是她们的菲利斯。

1407
01:03:08.760 --> 01:03:11.320
She's wearing a purple shirt under her blazer.
她西装外套里面穿了一件紫色衬衫。

1408
01:03:11.320 --> 01:03:16.740
And then, as Mark comes around the corner, he's going to speak to someone, and he's going
然后，当马克转过拐角时，他会去和某人说话，他会

