On Monday, they had a, and I quote, we will test the booger bubble at 10 a.m.
周一的时候，他们写着，引用一下，“我们将于上午10点测试鼻涕泡”。

1438
01:04:42.640 --> 01:04:44.980
Okay, I saw that as well, Angela.
好的，我也看到了，安吉拉。

1439
01:04:45.240 --> 01:04:45.480
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1440
01:04:45.880 --> 01:04:48.000
I love that they did a booger bubble teSt.
我喜欢他们居然还专门测试了鼻涕泡。

1441
01:04:48.220 --> 01:04:50.100
But I never saw a booger bubble.
但我从没看到过鼻涕泡。

1442
01:04:50.560 --> 01:04:55.760
Do you think that the test, like, didn't happen, and so they just were like, he'll just indicate
你觉得是不是测试没成功，所以他们就想，他只要假装

