I have to imagine that camera didn't really catch it, you know, when they did the camera
我猜摄像机可能没拍到，你知道，当他们做摄像机

1448
01:05:04.940 --> 01:05:05.300
teSt.
测试的时候。

1449
01:05:05.460 --> 01:05:06.700
They were like, oh, it doesn't really read.
他们可能觉得，噢，这在镜头里看不出来。

1450
01:05:06.700 --> 01:05:07.080
Yeah.
是啊。

1451
01:05:07.260 --> 01:05:08.140
I zoomed in.
我放大了。

