I want to say that when they tested things like this, they would often grab our stand-in,
我想说的是，当他们测试这类东西时，通常会找我们的替身演员，

1456
01:05:21.860 --> 01:05:28.060
Stephen Sox, and they would have put a booger bubble on him at 10 a.m., and then he would
斯蒂芬·索克斯，他们会在早上10点给他弄个鼻涕泡，然后他会

1457
01:05:28.060 --> 01:05:32.080
have walked into the bullpen, and they would have put the camera up, and then they would
走进办公区，他们会架起摄像机，然后

1458
01:05:32.080 --> 01:05:33.400
have said, no, it doesn't work.
