He did so many things like that.
他做了太多类似的事情了。

1461
01:05:36.460 --> 01:05:40.440
I really feel like at some point, we need to get Stephen and his wife, Lori.
我真的觉得在某个时候，我们需要请斯蒂芬和他的妻子洛丽来。

1462
01:05:40.660 --> 01:05:40.880
Yes.
是的。

1463
01:05:40.880 --> 01:05:46.260
They were our two stand-ins, because I want to hear stories of these crazy things that
他们是我们俩的替身，因为我想听听那些疯狂的事情，

1464
01:05:46.260 --> 01:05:47.400
