01:05:53.140 --> 01:05:54.220
to do behind the scenes?
最疯狂的事情吗？

1468
01:05:54.380 --> 01:05:54.700
Agree.
同意。

1469
01:05:55.040 --> 01:05:55.240
Okay.
好的。

1470
01:05:55.240 --> 01:05:56.400
Put that on the liSt.
