Before we step into his office, there was a line that cracked me up.
在我们走进他办公室之前，有一句台词让我笑喷了。

1475
01:06:05.460 --> 01:06:10.220
I thought our writers did a brilliant job of bringing Michael Scott into this moment in
我觉得我们的编剧在这一刻把迈克尔·斯科特写得太棒了，

