01:06:52.180 --> 01:06:53.320
And clacky balls.
还有咔哒咔哒响的球。

1500
01:06:53.860 --> 01:06:56.140
Clacky teeth, of course, made me think of Michael Scott.
咔哒咔哒响的假牙，当然让我想到了迈克尔·斯科特。

1501
01:06:56.260 --> 01:07:00.020
He has one of those magic eight balls, but it's the yellow one that looks like an emoji.
他有一个那种神奇八球，不过是黄色的，看起来像个表情包。

