我觉得我们应该听听看。

1519
01:07:35.420 --> 01:07:36.220
Oh, please.
噢，拜托。

1520
01:07:37.740 --> 01:07:39.680
What if Bob Dylan was your boss?
如果鲍勃·迪伦是你老板会怎样？

1521
01:07:40.780 --> 01:07:41.800
I'm going to do Dylan.
我要模仿迪伦了。

1522
01:07:45.780 --> 01:07:48.000
Pam Halpert is my name.
我叫帕姆·哈珀特。

1523
01:07:48.340 --> 01:07:53.340
I've been at Dunder Mifflin for seven years, eight years.
